 "meta": {
  "title": "Small building services board: Siemens LOGO! 8 control of lighting and pumps",
  "project": "EX-43",
  "client": "Example community centre",
  "author": "uniwire examples",
  
  "lang": "en",
  "notes": [
   "Demonstrates: small logic module (LOGO! 8 230RCE) with onboard I/O (slot 0 = relay outputs Q1-Q4) and expansion modules on the local bus; control links from slot.channel ports to lighting and motor contactors; motor protection circuit breakers",
   "Onboard inputs I1-I8 (230 V): astronomical / twilight switch, corridor push-buttons, PIR, pump float switches; AM2 input 1: sump level 4-20 mA",
   "Pumps alternate on each start (duty/standby); high-level alarm starts both"
  ]
 },
